<title>USA: Premier Concepts IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Premier Concepts IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Underwriter Cohig &amp; Associates said the planned initial public offering of Premier Concepts Inc has been postponed indefinitely.</p>
<p>The Aurora, Colorado company makes costume jewelry. It filed in August for an initial public offering. No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
